1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:06,600
Another rainy night.

2
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:11,700
Another ordinary day.

3
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:15,900
The same tired walk home.

4
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:21,300
Then the streetlight did something strange.

5
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:25,100
Someone was standing in the light.

6
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:29,100
It was you.

7
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:32,500
Fifteen years old.

8
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:39,800
What if you met yourself from 10 years ago?

9
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:44,500
"No way... is that us?"

10
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:48,900
He couldn't stop smiling.

11
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:55,100
"Did we become a musician?"

12
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:59,500
"...Not really."

13
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:05,600
"Did we see the ocean?"

14
00:01:08,800 --> 00:01:13,000
"I... watch videos about it."

15
00:01:14,100 --> 00:01:19,100
"Do we still draw every day?"

16
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:26,300
You used to. Every single day.

17
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:31,200
He looked at your room.

18
00:01:31,800 --> 00:01:35,400
At your life.

19
00:01:37,200 --> 00:01:40,800
"What happened to us?"

20
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:44,400
You didn't have an answer.

21
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:53,800
Every "later" crossed out a dream.

22
00:01:54,800 --> 00:01:59,600
He wasn't angry.

23
00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:05,600
He was just... disappointed.

24
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:13,000
"Here. Take it."

25
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:17,400
"You still have time."

26
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:22,000
"And you?"

27
00:02:23,700 --> 00:02:27,100
"I'm just a memory."

28
00:02:27,700 --> 00:02:32,300
"You're the one who's real."

29
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:37,400
"Make me proud."

30
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:41,400
The rain stopped.

31
00:02:42,800 --> 00:02:47,400
Day 1.

32
00:02:48,600 --> 00:02:51,400
Bad at first.

33
00:02:52,200 --> 00:02:55,000
Then a little better.

34
00:02:56,300 --> 00:03:02,300
Page after page.

35
00:03:03,800 --> 00:03:08,400
Every morning.

36
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:15,800
The first trip.

37
00:03:17,300 --> 00:03:23,300
The ocean. Finally.

38
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:29,400
And the call he kept postponing.

39
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:38,800
One dream at a time.

40
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:45,200
Ten years later, he came back to the same light.

41
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:51,800
This time, someone was waiting for him.

42
00:03:53,300 --> 00:03:57,900
Somewhere, 10 years from now...

43
00:03:59,300 --> 00:04:03,900
...someone is counting on you.

44
00:04:05,500 --> 00:04:11,100
Make them proud.

